  "_exec_summary": [
    {
      "ESSeqNum": 0,
      "FacilityID": 1000120159,
      "SummaryText": "Viking Chemical Co., is a distributor of industrial chemicals, water treatment chemicals and\nlubricants. It is located in a mixed industrial / residential area within the city of Rockford, IL.\nRegulated substance exceeding threshold quantity levels onsite are chlorine and sulfur dioxide.\nViking Chemical obtains chlorine and sulfur dioxide from a supplier for resale to end users. Chlorine and sulfur dioxide obtained by Viking Chemical are delivered by the supplier in sealed, capped cylinders. Viking Chemical delivers those same sealed, capped cylinders to customers. Viking Chemical does not use or open the chlorine or sulfur dioxide cylinders. The worst case scenario for both items is based on an immediate release of the greatest quantity stored in a single cylinder (2,000 pounds). The Alternative scenario is based on a leak over 60 minutes from a 150 pound cylinder.\nViking Chemical personnel are well trained (HAZWOPER) and supervised\nregarding the handling of hazardous materials. In the event of an uncontained or reportable release personnel are directed to immediately notify appropriate authorities.\nSince Viking Chemical is within the City of Rockford, the first emergency responder is the Rockford Fire Department HazMat unit. Viking Chemical values it's relationship with the Rockford Fire Department and has allowed the use of it's site for training exercises for that department.\nAnnually, Viking Chemical provides information to the Rockford Fire Department regarding not only the above described products but also relating to other portions of it's inventory. \nViking Chemical is an active member of the Winnebago County Local Emergency Planning\nCommittee (LEPC) and is aware of the public safety measures which would activate in the event of a release.\nIn addition to the foregoing, Viking Chemical has a working relationship with Hepaco (a regional\nemergency environmental clean-up contractor) for them to provide services as needed to Viking\nChemical."
    }
  ]
